      "parameters": {
        "content": "## How this works\n1. **Run manually** fires once when you click *Execute workflow*.\n2. Each **Gmail** node uses a *different credential* (one per Google account) and fetches up to 5 unread emails.\n3. **Tag as …** (Edit Fields) keeps only the fields we care about and adds `account` so we know where each email came from.\n4. **Combine inboxes** (Merge → Append) stacks both lists into one.\n\nClick any node after running to see its input/output items.",
